Third-party software
--------------------
The Windows installer bundles the following programs unmodified, each under
its own license:

* FFmpeg (ffmpeg.exe) — an LGPL build from BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds, licensed under
  the GNU Lesser General Public License; its license text ships next to it as
  ffmpeg-LICENSE.txt. Source code: https://ffmpeg.org/ and
  https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds.
* uv (uv.exe) by Astral — dual-licensed under Apache-2.0 or MIT.
  https://github.com/astral-sh/uv

Python packages (faster-whisper, CTranslate2, pyannote.audio, PyTorch and
others) are installed from their package indexes on first run under their own
licenses; they are not part of this repository.

Models
------
Models are downloaded at runtime from Hugging Face and are not distributed
with this product; each is governed by its own license:

* Speech recognition: Whisper models in the faster-whisper / CTranslate2
  format (faster-whisper and CTranslate2 are MIT-licensed).
* Speaker diarization: pyannote.audio (MIT-licensed code) with the
  pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1 pipeline, which requires accepting
  its terms of use on Hugging Face before download.
